WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.660 Coach helps you keep player development moving between lessons, not just while you are on court.
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:12.290 Plan the lesson, assign the next piece of work, review player proof, and track progress in one connected coaching path.
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:18.230 Give every player a clearer next step, while keeping your follow-up organized and easy to act on.
